#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/dependencies.rst:71
msgid ""
"This dependency setup would cause the following Migrations to be "
"additionally installed when an individual Migration was installed manually. "
"*Assumes* ``phpbb\\db\\migration\\data\\v310\\dev`` *is already installed.*"
msgstr ""
"Denne afhængighedsopsætning ville medføre, at følgende migreringer også "
"installeres, når en individuel migrering installeres manuelt. *Forudsætter, "
"at* ``phpbb\\db\\migration\\data\\v310\\dev`` *allerede er installeret.*"

